{
  "heading": "Configuration binding: Yon",
  "axis": "language",
  "summary": "One Setup role class carries the whole policy. Settings binds the YON_CATALOG_ prefix, and the Setup class's own fields are the settings, with @Min and @Max on a field. WhenProfile selects the active environment. WhenSetting turns the bean on or off based on a bound property. Setting binds a single canonical yon. path with a literal default. Every YON_CATALOG_ name in the snapshot must be declared. WhenProfile and WhenSetting are both decided before configure runs. The private snapshot stays private. Secrets live in .env. server/application.json holds placeholders and safe defaults. The controller returns selected fields that are not secret, never the resolved configuration.",
